      "value": "Yeah basically every voice communication app has a \"mic test\" feature, I'm surprised VRChat has none.\n\nIt has a volume bar sure, but there are cases when you want to hear what exactly is being sent to the other players.\n\nFor example after a headset resets/restarts my friends sometimes are telling me my voice has \"changed\". I have no way to hear it myself, so I can't even tell if it's good or bad, is it fixed after I did something or not - I have to ask everything.\n\nSame for people who are using voice changers - they have to ask others if it's working.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
